{"id":53,"slug":"53-lam-the-nao-de-tao-custom-form-validation","category":"HTML","subcategory":"Forms","level":"advanced","question_vi":"Làm thế nào để tạo custom form validation?","question_en":"How do you create custom form validation?","answer_vi":"Hai hướng, chọn theo mức độ kiểm soát giao diện cần có.\n\n**Cách 1 — giữ validation của browser, chỉ đổi lời báo lỗi:**\n\n```js\nconst pass2 = form.elements.confirmPassword\npass2.addEventListener('input', () => {\n  pass2.setCustomValidity(\n    pass2.value === form.elements.password.value ? '' : 'Mật khẩu nhập lại không khớp'\n  )\n})\n```\n\n**Cách 2 — tắt hẳn UI mặc định, tự dựng thông báo:**\n\n```html\n<form novalidate>                          <!-- tắt bong bóng của browser -->\n  <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required aria-describedby=\"email-err\">\n  <p id=\"email-err\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n</form>\n```\n\n```js\nform.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault()\n  const email = form.elements.email\n  const err = document.getElementById('email-err')\n  const ok = email.checkValidity()          // vẫn dùng lại được luật HTML\n  err.hidden = ok\n  err.textContent = ok ? '' : 'Email chưa hợp lệ'\n  email.setAttribute('aria-invalid', String(!ok))\n  if (ok) form.submit()\n})\n```\n\n**Lưu ý:** dựng thông báo lỗi bằng `<p>` thường thì screen reader không đọc. Cần `role=\"alert\"` (hoặc `aria-live`) và `aria-describedby` nối vào input.\n\n**Chốt:** `novalidate` chỉ tắt **giao diện** mặc định — `checkValidity()` và `validity` vẫn hoạt động, nên không phải viết lại luật kiểm tra từ đầu","answer_en":"Two approaches, chosen by how much control over the UI you need.\n\n**Option 1 — keep the browser's validation, change only the message:**\n\n```js\nconst pass2 = form.elements.confirmPassword\npass2.addEventListener('input', () => {\n  pass2.setCustomValidity(\n    pass2.value === form.elements.password.value ? '' : 'Passwords do not match'\n  )\n})\n```\n\n**Option 2 — turn off the default UI and render your own:**\n\n```html\n<form novalidate>                          <!-- suppress the browser bubble -->\n  <input name=\"email\" type=\"email\" required aria-describedby=\"email-err\">\n  <p id=\"email-err\" role=\"alert\" hidden></p>\n</form>\n```\n\n```js\nform.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {\n  e.preventDefault()\n  const email = form.elements.email\n  const err = document.getElementById('email-err')\n  const ok = email.checkValidity()          // the HTML rules still apply\n  err.hidden = ok\n  err.textContent = ok ? '' : 'That email is not valid'\n  email.setAttribute('aria-invalid', String(!ok))\n  if (ok) form.submit()\n})\n```\n\n**Note:** rendering the error in a plain `<p>` leaves screen readers silent. It needs `role=\"alert\"` (or `aria-live`) and an `aria-describedby` link from the input.\n\n**Takeaway:** `novalidate` only disables the default **UI** — `checkValidity()` and `validity` keep working, so you never rewrite the rules themselves","answer_html_vi":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Hai hướng, chọn theo mức độ kiểm soát giao diện cần có.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Cách 1 — giữ validation của browser, chỉ đổi lời báo lỗi:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const pass2 = form.elements.confirmPassword\npass2.addEventListener('input', () =&gt; {\n  pass2.setCustomValidity(\n    pass2.value === form.elements.password.value ? '' : 'Mật khẩu nhập lại không khớp'\n  )\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> pass2 = form.<span class=\"hljs-property\">elements</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">confirmPassword</span>\npass2.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;input&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  pass2.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setCustomValidity</span>(\n    pass2.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> === form.<span class=\"hljs-property\">elements</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">password</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> ? <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> : <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Mật khẩu nhập lại không khớp&#x27;</span>\n  )\n})</code></pre></div><p><strong>Cách 2 — tắt hẳn UI mặc định, tự dựng thông báo:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">html</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"&lt;form novalidate&gt;                          &lt;!-- tắt bong bóng của browser --&gt;\n  &lt;input name=&quot;email&quot; type=&quot;email&quot; required aria-describedby=&quot;email-err&quot;&gt;\n  &lt;p id=&quot;email-err&quot; role=&quot;alert&quot; hidden&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\n&lt;/form&gt;\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">novalidate</span>&gt;</span>                          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">&lt;!-- tắt bong bóng của browser --&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">input</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">type</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">required</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">aria-describedby</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email-err&quot;</span>&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">id</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;email-err&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">role</span>=<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;alert&quot;</span> <span class=\"hljs-attr\">hidden</span>&gt;</span><span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">p</span>&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-tag\">&lt;/<span class=\"hljs-name\">form</span>&gt;</span></code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"form.addEventListener('submit', (e) =&gt; {\n  e.preventDefault()\n  const email = form.elements.email\n  const err = document.getElementById('email-err')\n  const ok = email.checkValidity()          // vẫn dùng lại được luật HTML\n  err.hidden = ok\n  err.textContent = ok ? '' : 'Email chưa hợp lệ'\n  email.setAttribute('aria-invalid', String(!ok))\n  if (ok) form.submit()\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\">form.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">addEventListener</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;submit&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">(<span class=\"hljs-params\">e</span>) =&gt;</span> {\n  e.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">preventDefault</span>()\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> email = form.<span class=\"hljs-property\">elements</span>.<span class=\"hljs-property\">email</span>\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> err = <span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">document</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">getElementById</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;email-err&#x27;</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> ok = email.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">checkValidity</span>()          <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// vẫn dùng lại được luật HTML</span>\n  err.<span class=\"hljs-property\">hidden</span> = ok\n  err.<span class=\"hljs-property\">textContent</span> = ok ? <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> : <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Email chưa hợp lệ&#x27;</span>\n  email.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">setAttribute</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;aria-invalid&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">String</span>(!ok))\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (ok) form.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">submit</span>()\n})</code></pre></div><p class=\"qa-summary\"><strong>Lưu ý:</strong> dựng thông báo lỗi bằng <code>&lt;p&gt;</code> thường thì screen reader không đọc. Cần <code>role=\"alert\"</code> (hoặc <code>aria-live</code>) và <code>aria-describedby</code> nối vào input.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Chốt:</strong> <code>novalidate</code> chỉ tắt <strong>giao diện</strong> mặc định — <code>checkValidity()</code> và <code>validity</code> vẫn hoạt động, nên không phải viết lại luật kiểm tra từ đầu.</p>","answer_html_en":"<p class=\"qa-summary\">Two approaches, chosen by how much control over the UI you need.</p><p class=\"qa-detail\"><strong>Option 1 — keep the browser's validation, change only the message:</strong></p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">js</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const pass2 = form.elements.confirmPassword\npass2.addEventListener('input', () =&gt; {\n  pass2.setCustomValidity(\n    pass2.value === form.elements.password.value ? '' : 'Passwords do not match'\n  )\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</spa